## Data work (delete this section if the project has no data platform)

- **Source ladder — never invert it:** semantic layer / metric contract → governed model → hand SQL
  over silver → raw. Going down a rung is allowed; going down *silently* is not.
- **Never invent a metric.** If it has no contract in `.sdd/steering/semantic-layer.md`, propose the
  definition (formula + grain + population), get it confirmed, write it there, then use it.
- **Every reported number carries its provenance** — source, metric, freshness, validation,
  confidence (`.sdd/settings/rules/answer-provenance.md`). A number with no source is a guess with
  formatting.
- Rules: `.sdd/settings/rules/data-readiness.md` (source ladder, agent-ready checklist).

